      "Each case replaces its named input fields in defaults. Each segment inherits the selected source, channel, period and dtype unless it overrides them. Segment start_ns defaults to zero. A segment's repeat field concatenates its sample block that many times.",
      "Windows are half-open UTC nanosecond intervals. Strings of the form numerator/denominator specify exact rational nanoseconds. Mask triples specify a segment ID and half-open sample indices. NaN is encoded as a string.",
      "The source and channel identify the selected recording. A per-window background_source can override its source identity. Epoch labels describe synthetic evidence. The unknown epoch has no response evidence.",
      "Unavailable cases list the reasons the computation must report. Additional applicable reasons may accompany them. Unavailable contrast is null. Numeric fields omitted from an expectation are unspecified."
